          "name": "列表内手动添加\n统一 AI 整理流程",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "列表内手动添加\n统一 AI 整理流程",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 34,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "D1IGP",
          "name": "这是可编辑状态稿与交互约定，不代表应用已经实现。",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "这是可编辑状态稿与交互约定，不代表应用已经实现。旧轮次说明与此冲突时，以本板及设计变更文档为准。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jvHBN",
          "name": "01  手动：标题即可保存",
          "fill": "$primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "01  手动：标题即可保存",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "L5css",
          "name": "＋ 添加待办 → 列表原地展开 → 添加 / 回",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "＋ 添加待办 → 列表原地展开 → 添加 / 回车 → 真实任务行 + 保留下一条输入。计划、安排日期、优先级、备注均可选，不调用 AI。今日默认安排今天；其他筛选默认未安排。失败保留输入并重试；筛选外显示查看新任务。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FGbcE",
          "name": "02  AI：明确独立的输入",
          "fill": "$primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "02  AI：明确独立的输入",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "O7ADD",
          "name": "Mac 顶部快捷输入可直接整理；麦克风 / 展开",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Mac 顶部快捷输入可直接整理；麦克风 / 展开携带草稿打开面板。iPhone 三个导航标签右侧为56pt独立 AI 操作按钮，不是第四标签。编辑、键盘、其他浮层出现时避让或隐藏。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "E4FoV",
          "name": "03  同一草稿，不重复提交",
          "fill": "$primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "03  同一草稿，不重复提交",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "oYK7V",
          "name": "首次不录音、不请求权限；iPhone 首次不唤起",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "首次不录音、不请求权限；iPhone 首次不唤起键盘。文字 / 语音共用草稿，停止只转写；点击整理并添加才提交。收起保留草稿与处理进度，重开恢复，主动清空。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bsWJk",
          "name": "04  准确结果与风险确认",
          "fill": "$primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "04  准确结果与风险确认",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Mp448",
          "name": "新增 / 更新 / 记录 / 待确认分开，原文随",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "新增 / 更新 / 记录 / 待确认分开，原文随时可查看。明确新任务直接创建；归属不确定先待归类；新计划、删除取消、硬截止修改、批量移动汇总预览确认。失败不把原文保存称作任务创建。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "q8GAf",
          "name": "05  子任务、日期与详情",
          "fill": "$primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "05  子任务、日期与详情",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WXnJ0",
          "name": "在父任务下添加子任务并继承计划和阶段，父节点仅汇",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "在父任务下添加子任务并继承计划和阶段，父节点仅汇总叶子进度。任务标题和快捷属性就地编辑，完整备注进入详情。安排日期不是硬截止；明天做不推断硬截止。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 15,
